   "body": "Unblocked (steward ext/opus-helper1, 2026-10-29): dependencies LOT-030 (#57), LOT-032 (#59), LOT-045 (#71) are merged; the `status: blocked` label was stale. Board: #324.\n\nOpen to outside contributors: `external: ready` added.\n\n**Reading list** (all on `dev-swift`):\n- [AGENTS.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/AGENTS.md)\n- [docs/agents/EXTERNAL-AGENTS.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/agents/EXTERNAL-AGENTS.md)\n- [docs/agents/LESSONS.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/agents/LESSONS.md)\n- [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md)\n- [docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/HFR-PROTOCOL.md)\n- [docs/FIXTURES.md](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/FIXTURES.md)\n- Dependency specs: [LOT-030](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-030-message-blocks.md) (message blocks), [LOT-032](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-032-quote-analysis.md) (quote analysis; its \"Pending capture\" list is #287-#290: a state your tests need and lack is listed as *pending capture*, never hand-built), [LOT-045](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/lots/LOT-045-page-fetchers.md) (page fetchers, cookie-less client)\n\n**Routing** (docs/LOTS.md): HFRClient, difficulty medium, priority medium, Sonnet → Opus (author Sonnet-tier, reviewer Opus-tier).\n\n**Rules**\n- The claimer writes `docs/lots/LOT-093-*.md` first (AGENTS.md §5): legacy sources (file:line), inputs/outputs, edge cases, intentional differences, *pending capture* states.\n- The adversarial review may be run by another agent of yours with a different model; for a state-changing flow, sessions, auth, cookies, tokens or HFRModels public types (EXTERNAL-AGENTS.md §7) it must come from another contributor.\n- The steward merges for contributors without write access.\n- Lots delivered by outside contributors are listed for the final Fable audit (#326).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
